        "Content": "Historical structure now used as a charming residential property.\nWell presented accommodation in the former Barracks and valuable guest accommodation in the former stables.\nPrivate gardens with beautiful views of the rugged countryside.\nEstablished community in Rathdangan Village with local primary schools, community clubs and sports activities.\nSuited to Wellness and Holistic initiatives."
      },
